  "doc.title": "What Quantum Computers Can Actually Do · From First Principles to the Frontier",
  "doc.desc": "What can a quantum computer do that an ordinary one cannot? The page runs a real state-vector simulator: one qubit, interference, entanglement, Grover search, Shor factoring, noise and error correction, ending with a dated, sourced account of the 2026 frontier.",
